    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d366">

                <pb facs="0443" n="369" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg369"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/1250</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-07T20:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 7, 1918, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 9, 4.40
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2346. Nothing from Brest. Unconfirmed report that separate peace concluded but
                    conditions so outrageous that incredible.</p>
                <p>Council by decree signed by “Lenin and five other Commissaries issued to-day
                    changes Russian calendar to accord with ours, taking effect Russia February 1
                    which decree designates February 14 in Russia.</p>
                <p>Patriarch, according to the laws Russian church, has excommunicated all
                    Bolsheviki because of confiscation of church property and violence to
                    clergy.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
